Swami\/documentation\/Swami","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/swipeActions(edge:allowsFullSwipe:content:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"swipeActions(edge:allowsFullSwipe:content:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"swipeActions","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"edge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI14HorizontalEdgeO","text":"HorizontalEdge","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"allowsFullSwipe","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentif